{"id":"vod_md_6253","vodId":"6253","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"无彩限的怪灵世界","name_cn":"无彩限的怪灵世界","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231024-1/1d307bafa7ddcb048d349eff2ad74a47.jpg"},"summary":"在这个世界上，存在着一种名为“怪灵”的生物。故事发生在弗塞亚学院之中，在那里，设立了名为“脑机能异常对策室”的机构，专门解决怪灵带来的危险和麻烦。一条晴彦（下野紘 配音）是一年级新生，亦是对策室的成员，他拥有能够使用绘画封印怪灵的能力，是足智多谋的军师。川神舞（上坂堇 配音）是一条晴彦的学姐，个性开朗行事冲动的她常常惹出不少的麻烦，和晴彦组成了搭档相互取长补短居然格外的般配。除此之外，温文尔雅的千金大小姐和泉玲奈（早见沙织 配音），特立独行的孤高展示水无濑小系（内田真礼 配音），这些孩子们集结在一起，为了保护他们挚爱的朋友和家园向怪灵发起了宣战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-24 08:14:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/ZLShh2Yd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/bb7KWpMK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/o1mR0FqC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/VDKD5kLl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/3zumY3It/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/lbJ0UUWz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/LM9m4EYx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/lJZxNYMZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/DCdWPvlT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/CkJTZmaW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/wQZ8nide/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/ihKn792W/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/kj3gPXBB/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:48.065Z"}